-projets","target":"https://www.todoist.com/help/articles/create-a-sub-project-in-todoist-aTA15C70","line":30},{"title":"Sub-projects classified under each area of ​​action","target":"https://res.cloudinary.com/imagist/image/fetch/q_auto,f_auto,c_scale,w_628/https%3A%2F%2Fimages.ctfassets.net%2Fdm4oa8qtogq0%2F010UGZmPeDlJEVja99khBk%2F003c133d88955f1e301d15d6acf99d15%2FAreas_of_responsibility.png","line":35,"embedded":true},{"title":"ajoutant l'étiquette","target":"https://www.todoist.com/help/articles/introduction-to-labels-dSo2eE","line":45},{"title":"See all your tasks tagged @next","target":"https://res.cloudinary.com/imagist/image/fetch/q_auto,f_auto,c_scale,w_800/https%3A%2F%2Fimages.ctfassets.net%2Fdm4oa8qtogq0%2F2ct6KH6Tgvkz1iSwoQ48Re%2F917570abd62978a78b3b4c4a0d35339a%2FNext_label_list.png","line":47,"embedded":true},{"title":"Create a new @next label","target":"https://res.cloudinary.com/imagist/image/fetch/q_auto,f_auto,c_scale,w_800/https%3A%2F%2Fimages.ctfassets.net%2Fdm4oa8qtogq0%2F4tFyKmYUFJFcd05P6Q4MBO%2Fe78556439cc0dad331f6810101678f9c%2FCreate_new_label.png","line":47,"embedded":true},{"title":"planifiez-les","target":"https://www.todoist.com/help/articles/introduction-to-dates-and-time-q7VobO","line":51},{"title":"Enter a due date in the task field using natural language, such as “Friday”","target":"https://res.cloudinary.com/imagist/image/fetch/q_auto,f_auto,c_scale,w_800/https%3A%2F%2Fimages.ctfassets.net%2Fdm4oa8qtogq0%2F65dc28mR6HsYivzHSZbCKs%2F9e79f4d60e18540c4f55f3892748777b%2FSmart_date_Quick_Add.png","line":55,"embedded":true},{"title":"compte Todoist avec Google Agenda","target":"https://todoist.com/help/articles/use-google-calendar-with-todoist-QcGnb1uZ","line":59},{"title":"View your Todoist tasks in your Google Calendar and your Google Calendar events in Todoist.","target":"https://res.cloudinary.com/imagist/image/fetch/q_auto,f_auto,c_scale,w_800/https%3A%2F%2Fimages.ctfassets.net%2Fdm4oa8qtogq0%2F72K9vMz0y7YHsFyDWQUAC9%2F6bc3ba541f1a9